    <h2>The Vision: AI That's Visible, Measurable, Manageable</h2>

    <p>Every bot in the system is three things:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Visible</strong> &mdash; appears on an org chart with an avatar, defined role, and reporting lines. You know exactly who does what.</li>
      <li><strong>Measurable</strong> &mdash; productivity scores, tasks completed, hours saved, cost tracked. Real numbers, not vibes.</li>
      <li><strong>Manageable</strong> &mdash; pause it. Reassign it. View its logs. Get alerts when something breaks. Full control, always.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Think of it like an HR dashboard, except nobody calls in sick and nobody needs a pizza party to stay motivated.</p>

