    <p>A title company processing 50 orders per month was spending 15-20 minutes on manual data entry per order. AI reduced that to 2 minutes. 12 emails per transaction were automated. Client FAQ handling went from 10 hours per week to zero. Result: 75+ hours per month freed, capacity doubled without hiring.</p>

